title Vinyl Knock-knock refused by the launcher (another app holds the screen off, or no service): the notice "Screen off is not available.", the screen and the input stay as they were
sizes 640x480
ppmm 901
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_SCREEN fail
env VINYL_DEMO_KNOCK 1

wait 800
tapxy 0.223 0.373
tapxy 0.223 0.373
tapxy 0.223 0.373
wait 400
shot 01-refused-notice
expect text "Screen off is not available."
tap "Evolve 65"
wait 300
expect text "Automatic"
shot 02-input-stays
expect noquit
